  "从 OpenCode 的 auth.json 读取登录态：Anthropic 登录会变成 Claude 账号，OpenAI / Google 的 Key 变成对应的接口账号。": "Read the login from OpenCode's auth.json: an Anthropic login becomes a Claude account, and OpenAI / Google keys become the matching API accounts.",
