  "修复这个 bug，让复现测试通过，且不破坏其它测试。\n\nbug：{{input}}\n\n复现情况：\n{{nodes.repro.output}}": "Fix this bug so that the reproducing test passes without breaking any other tests.\n\nBug: {{input}}\n\nReproduction details:\n{{nodes.repro.output}}",
