  "先写一个能复现下面这个 bug 的失败测试（不要修 bug），跑一下确认它确实失败，汇报测试文件和失败信息。\n\nbug：{{input}}": "First write a failing test that reproduces the bug below (do not fix the bug). Run it to confirm that it really fails, and report the test file and the failure message.\n\nBug: {{input}}",
  "先写复现测试，再一直修到测试通过，最后回归": "First write a reproducing test, then keep fixing until the test passes, and finally run a regression check",
