  "在 Bot 资料里调高预算": "Raise the budget in the bot's profile",
  "在 Claude Web 里的约定（优先于下面说明里的例子）：\n- 每次调用 ego_browser 都是一个新进程：Space 和标签页会留着，JS 变量不会。\n- Space 一律用 `await taskSpace(CW_SPACE)`（这个对话的是「{space}」），不要另起名字，也不要动用户自己的 Space 和标签页。\n- 截图存到 `CW_OUT` 目录（例如 `path.join(CW_OUT, \"shot.png\")`，需要 `import path from \"node:path\"`），这一轮存下的图片会一起交给你看。\n- 用 console.log 输出你要读的东西；一轮不要做太多事，先 snapshot 再操作。\n": "Conventions in Claude Web (these come before the examples in the guide below):\n- Every ego_browser call is a new process: the Space and its tabs stay, JS variables don't.\n- Always use `await taskSpace(CW_SPACE)` for the Space (this conversation's is \"{space}\"). Don't make up another name, and don't touch the user's own Spaces and tabs.\n- Save screenshots into the `CW_OUT` folder (for example `path.join(CW_OUT, \"shot.png\")`, which needs `import path from \"node:path\"`); the pictures saved in a round are handed to you with its result.\n- Print what you need to read with console.log. Don't do too much in one round: snapshot first, then act.\n",
